{"strongs": "H6647", "word": "ᵑ7", "translit": "tse.va", "root": "", "morph": "A:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "dip, wet", "definition": "I. [ צְבַע ] verb dip, wet ( ᵑ7 Syriac; compare Biblical Hebrew I. צבע ); — Pa`el Participle active plural מְצַבְּעִין Dan 4:22 wet thee ( ל ), + מִטַּל . Hithpa. Imperfect יִצְטַבּע (also בַּ֑ע -), be wet , with בְּטַל Dan 4:12 ; Dan 4:20 , מִטַּל v. Dan 4:30 ; Dan 5:21 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9834')\">BDB9834</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6647')\">H6647</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H6648')\">H6648</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9833')\">BDB9833</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9835')\">BDB9835</entry></div><p> I. [<bdbarc>צְבַע</bdbarc>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>dip, wet</highlightword> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> Syriac; compare Biblical Hebrew I.  <bdbheb><reflink>צבע</reflink></bdbheb>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Pa`el</b> <highlight>Participle active</highlight> plural <bdbarc>מְצַבְּעִין</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 4:22\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,22)\">Dan 4:22</ref> <highlight>wet</highlight> thee (<bdbarc>ל</bdbarc>), + <bdbarc>מִטַּל</bdbarc>. <b>Hithpa.</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbarc>יִצְטַבּע</bdbarc> (also <bdbarc>בַּ֑ע</bdbarc>-), <highlight>be wet</highlight>, with <bdbarc>בְּטַל</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 4:12\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,12)\">Dan 4:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 4:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,20)\">Dan 4:20</ref>, <bdbarc>מִטַּל</bdbarc> v.<ref ref=\"Dan 4:30\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,30)\">Dan 4:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 5:21\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,21)\">Dan 5:21</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "re